BIOBYTES - PERSONALISED FOOD RECOMMENDATION SYSTEM ——“‘(CO!;!*;*;*;*~*~;*CO2A:~S”#
BioBytes is an advanced personalized food recommendation system leveraging GenAI, LangChain. It utilizes
Neo4j as a graph database to provide highly personalized food suggestions based on a patient's specific illness
rather than generalized recommendations.

Tech stack: Genai, Langchain, RAG, Neo4j, Graph DB.

CONVERSATIONAL AI MEETS PDF - PUBLISHED RESEARCH PAPER (IEEE )
This paper introduces a Generative AI (GenAI) system that revolutionizes static PDF interaction through
conversational engagement. Using a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) framework, it converts PDFs into
vector embeddings with models like BERT or GPT and stores them in a vector database for semantic search.
Upon user queries, relevant content is retrieved, and coherent responses are generated. Applications span
academic research, legal review, and healthcare, with future plans for enhanced conversation and multimodal
integration.

Tech stack: Langchain, RAG, Similarity Search, Vector Embeddings.

